B.hcy=new A.uG("3. Information Sharing and Disclosure","We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information only in the following circumstances: with your consent, to comply with legal obligations, to protect our rights and safety, with service providers who assist us in operating our platform (under strict confidentiality agreements), and in connection with a business transfer or merger.")
B.hcz=new A.uG("9. Children's Privacy","NDU Project is not intended for individuals under the age of 18. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you become aware that a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately.")
